                <pb facs="0600" n="540" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg540"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure in No. 355.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Passport No. 6289, issued by the Department of State, Washington, D. C., on
                    January 2, 1894, to Jacob Malin Weiler, upon which was indorsed:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Translation.]</p>
                <p>“Expelled from Prussian territory by direction of the Royal Government president
                    at Frankfort on the Oder, of March 27, 1894.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">“<placeName>Sorau</placeName>. <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1894-04-04">April 4,
                    1894</date>.”</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
